<div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h4 id="为什么这样有效" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#为什么这样有效"><span><strong>为什么这样有效？</strong></span></a></h4>
<ul>
<li><strong>数学特性：</strong> <code v-pre>exp(-inf) = 0</code>，所以 <code v-pre>-inf</code> 经过 <strong>Softmax</strong> 后概率为 <strong>0</strong></li>
<li><strong>归一化保证： Softmax</strong> 保证所有概率和为 <strong>1</strong>，被屏蔽位置的概率被分配给其他位置</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="_3-提示工程" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-提示工程"><span><strong>3. 提示工程</strong></span></a></h2>
